# CWC product IA & MVP

Authoritative requirements: `CWC_Health_App/01_CWC_Health_App_Feature_Specification_v0.4.md`.

## Navigation (non-negotiable)

- Bottom tabs only: **Nearby | My Health | Learn | More** — icon + label, ≥48dp. **No hamburger / drawer.**
- **My Health** is the default landing tab (P1 CWC feedback). Nearby stays a tab.
- Persistent **Help Now** control in every screen header; never gated by PIN.
- Max **two taps** from any tab root to a core task.
- **More** is a plain large-type list (tutorials, Ask a Peer, Helper Mode, Settings, privacy, erase)—not a drawer.

## MVP feature boundaries

| Area | Do | Don’t |
|------|----|-------|
| Nearby | Town/region picker first; list + walk-time; offline cache; optional GPS + OSM map | Require location at launch; miles-only; paid map APIs |
| My Health | Manual appointments/meds/providers; portal **link-out**; wallet card; optional PIN | Store portal credentials; EHR sync (this award) |
| Learn | Survey domains, plus Sleep as its own area. Stress stays inside Physical Health. Source labels; offline; ~6th-grade | AI chat/answers; Sleep nested under Physical Health; Stress as its own card; Medications as a Learn tile (lists live in My Health) |
| Help Now | Offline: 988 call+text, 911, Poison Control, CWC, NJ peer warmline; emergency card **off** by default | PIN wall; alarm-only “EMERGENCY” tone without CAB buy-in |
| Accounts | No account required; local personal data; guest/kiosk for center devices | Mandatory login/email/phone |

Working tab/Help Now labels are co-design hypotheses—keep them easy to rename.
